(14 Oct 2026   10:24 AM | Kumar R. \(LTTS\)   Suspension Engineering Team) Tj
T*
(The latest Rebound Bumper Batch B is showing a compression set of approximately 18% against) Tj
T*
(the specification limit of  15%. This may affect long-term energy absorption and durability.) Tj
T*
(Please investigate the root cause, check the moulding process and recommend containment and) Tj
T*
(corrective action. Please confirm whether the remaining batch should be held pending review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
