(15 Oct 2026   02:17 PM | Meera S. \(Tenneco\)   Kumar R. \(LTTS\)) Tj
T*
(We reviewed the material certificate, incoming inspection and moulding history. The) Tj
T*
(available evidence points to inadequate material drying before moulding. Please trial) Tj
T*
(controlled drying at 100  C for 4 hours, record the actual drying cycle and mould the) Tj
T*
(validation samples. Update the process document if the trial confirms the improvement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(16 Oct 2026   11:03 AM | Kumar R. \(LTTS\)   Meera S. \(Tenneco\)) Tj
T*
(The controlled-drying trial and repeat test are complete. The measured compression set is) Tj
T*
(now 12%, within the  15% limit. The process record has been updated for the trial. The) Tj
